---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+17725550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(772) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Mold Removal in Fort Pierce, FL | Fort Pierce Mold Specialists" description="Safe, thorough mold removal in Fort Pierce, FL. Licensed specialists, proper containment, and lasting results.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Mold Removal in Fort Pierce, FL</h1>
      <p>Safe, thorough mold removal in Fort Pierce, FL. Licensed specialists, proper containment, and lasting results.</p>
      <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top:1.25rem">Call </a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px">
<h2>Professional Mold Removal</h2>
<p>Removing mold correctly means protecting occupants and the rest of the building while eliminating the growth. We follow industry best practices for containment, removal, and cleaning.</p>
<ul>
<li>Isolation of the affected zone</li>
<li>Careful removal of contaminated materials</li>
<li>Cleaning of non-porous surfaces</li>
<li>Disposal according to local guidelines</li>
</ul>
<p>DIY removal of large or hidden mold often spreads spores and leaves roots of the problem behind. Let our team handle it safely.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:2rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call Now — </a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
